<title>UK: Chevron finds oil in N.Sea Bressay well.</title>
<headline>Chevron finds oil in N.Sea Bressay well.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chevron Corp completed Bressay appraisal well 3/28a-4Z in the northern North Sea and encountered oil in the Paleocene reservoir but had to abandon the well before tests because of bad weather, consultants Arthur Andersen said.</p>
<p>Andersen said in their weekly well report that the well was plugged and abandoned and Chevron was due to make an announcement soon giving details.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7630</p>
